\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Abstention sweep over $\tau _{\mathrm  {abs}}\in \{0.05,0.99\}$, mean over LOAO folds, on excluded-family test rows. \textbf  {UNSW:} an operating frontier exists---abstention and false attack attribution cross near $\tau {=}0.5$, and large $\tau $ recovers honesty (97\% abstain, $<$1\% false attribution). \textbf  {CIC:} no operating point---unseen-family events are absorbed into \texttt  {normal} ($\sim $94\%) at saturated confidence (median max-prob $1.000$; median margin $1.000$), so no post-hoc threshold or margin policy can recover them.}}{6}{figure.caption.23}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:tau}{{1}{6}{Abstention sweep over $\tau _{\mathrm {abs}}\in \{0.05,0.99\}$, mean over LOAO folds, on excluded-family test rows. \textbf {UNSW:} an operating frontier exists---abstention and false attack attribution cross near $\tau {=}0.5$, and large $\tau $ recovers honesty (97\% abstain, $<$1\% false attribution). \textbf {CIC:} no operating point---unseen-family events are absorbed into \texttt {normal} ($\sim $94\%) at saturated confidence (median max-prob $1.000$; median margin $1.000$), so no post-hoc threshold or margin policy can recover them}{figure.caption.23}{}}
